{"step_index":86,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:16:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-14T09:16:05+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-14T09:16:10+09:00\nThe search for \"\"(주)쉐어트리츠\" 전화번호 OR 대표번호\" returned the following summary:\n동남아시아 기반 모바일 선물하기(기프티콘) 플랫폼 서비스 기업인 **(주)쉐어트리츠(Share Treats Innovation)**는 주로 필리핀, 인도네시아 등 해외 시장을 타겟으로 비즈니스를 전개하고 있어[1], 국내 일반 고객을 대상으로 하는 오프라인 유선 대표번호(콜센터 번호)는 대외적으로 공개되어 있지 않습니다.\n\n주요 서비스 관련 고객 응대 및 문의는 주로 이메일이나 온라인 채널을 통해 이루어집니다.\n\n* **공식 이메일 문의:** support@sharetreats.com[2]\n* **참고 연락처 (해외 서비스 현지 고객센터 기준):**\n  * 필리핀 유선번호: +63 2-8994-0446[2]\n  * 필리핀 모바일 핫라인: +63 917-712-4921[2]\n\nSources:\n[1] [wanted.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLtau67zvyJQQUd05EQYegoSC8YXJyFqOJgtWk8T81BKUUwXyxW7AR6LbMkqzs8uejAamiHZjg5g2qWSR8CXo1HO6b04PVMBX8DZMqBciB9JWOb4GpllVIApiqiA==)\n[2] [gcash.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGj-duxcHfoaVQWnfv0bm5UQRWoY-TA91c9Qo0WA5r2029SorEiqtQp5u8xoSoYw2dDzjzgoaAffWaBe_tI8fP56cd4vbrknvc9I8lQdOzqnHOMSzYHj4F8KoauKEnRZwBRu3kiVgs6tzZyRiOQwcDJcramlRkXdL8_P27CyYnQpwPRpyEpwvT1uDM=)"}
{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:16:10Z","input_tokens":3270,"cache_read_tokens":142551,"output_tokens":969,"thinking":"`search_web` functionality is confirmed; the focus now shifts to crafting the initial batch script. This script will query Bizno using business registration numbers for the 406 missing companies. Parsing logic for Bizno must accurately extract the phone number, specifically using regular expressions to capture the telephone number from the HTML content.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nasync function runBatchTest() {\\n  const missing = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('missing_phone_targets.json', 'utf8'));\\n  console.log('Total targets:', missing.length);\\n\\n  const sample = missing.slice(0, 30);\\n  const results = [];\\n\\n  for (let i = 0; i < sample.length; i++) {\\n    const item = sample[i];\\n    const cleanBizNo = item.bizNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n    let phone = '';\\n\\n    if (cleanBizNo.length === 10) {\\n      try {\\n        const url = 'https://bizno.net/article/' + cleanBizNo;\\n        const res = await fetch(url, {\\n          headers: {\\n            'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\\n          }\\n        });\\n        if (res.ok) {\\n          const html = await res.text();\\n          const thMatch = html.match(/<th>전화번호<\\\\/th>\\\\s*<td[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/td>/i);\\n          if (thMatch) {\\n            const inner = thMatch[1];\\n            const telMatch = inner.match(/<a href=['\\\"]tel:([^'\\\"]+)['\\\"]/) || inner.match(/([0-9]{2,4}-[0-9]{3,4}-[0-9]{4}|1[0-9]{3}-[0-9]{4})/);\\n            if (telMatch) {\\n              phone = telMatch[1].trim();\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        console.error(`Error fetching ${item.name}:`, err.message);\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    results.push({\\n      seq: item.seq,\\n      name: item.name,\\n      ceo: item.ceo,\\n      bizNo: item.bizNo,\\n      phone: phone\\n    });\\n\\n    console.log(`[${i+1}/${sample.length}] ${item.seq} ${item.name} -> ${phone || '미확인'}`);\\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 400));\\n  }\\n\\n  const foundCount = results.filter(r => r.phone).length;\\n  console.log(`\\\\nSample result: ${foundCount}/${sample.length} found (${(foundCount/sample.length*100).toFixed(1)}%)`);\\n}\\n\\nrunBatchTest();\\n\"","Description":"\"Batch test first 30 missing phone targets\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\find_company_phone_numbers\\\\batch_test_30.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating batch test script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write batch_test_30.js\""}}]}
